{
  "$comment": [
    "Curated highlights for figures/landscape/: every pathway selection and every named gene, site",
    "or metabolite a panel or sub-table draws because someone chose it, not because a",
    "computation selected it. Panel and table scripts read them through scripts/lib/highlights.R.",
    "",
    "pathways: one selection per key. match_on names the field a script matches the ORA",
    "or CAMERA results on; the other fields are for reading. panels and tables name who",
    "reads the selection; provenance names where it was curated before it moved here.",
    "",
    "features: the single-feature plots, keyed by panel and then by plot. tissues and omes",
    "are passed to plot_single_feature() as selected_tissues and selected_omes; title,",
    "where present, replaces the plot title.",
    "",
    "gene_lists: a hand-picked set of gene symbols a heatmap draws, keyed by panel.",
    "",
    "named_features: the features discussed in the manuscript, for ST1e (and ED1C).",
    "notes carries the symbol and site the manuscript uses.",
    "",
    "clinical_omics_features: the baseline clinical x omics features the manuscript selected",
    "for EDT1, keyed by table. trait is the Stage 07 name, timepoint the acute response the",
    "manuscript reports, notes the molecule description."
  ],
